{"id": "dd8eb7ae-6c40-4b95-865b-3cc5a1423ae1", "slug": "cli-dashboard-jetbrains-emerald-model", "title": "CLI Dashboard - JetBrains Emerald Model", "description": "Cli Jetbrains Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"CLI Dashboard - JetBrains Emerald Model\"\ndescription: \"Cli Jetbrains Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#A9B7C6\"\n  accent: \"#065F46\"\n  background: \"#1E1E1E\"\n  surface: \"#A9B7C6\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2B2D30\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"9999px\"\n  control: \"32px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# CLI Dashboard - JetBrains Emerald Model\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 97; favorites: 10; remixes: 2.\nTags: login, animated, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nCli Jetbrains Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nVERTEX Documentation Sign In Vertex Engine v2.4.0 active Orchestrate your systems from a unified terminal Synchronize your environments seamlessly. Codebases, deployment pipelines, package registries, and developer work…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Orchestrate your systems from a unified terminal.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #A9B7C6, accent #065F46, background #1E1E1E, surface #A9B7C6, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>CLI Dashboard - JetBrains Emerald Model</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#1e1e1e] text-[#a9b7c6] antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen selection:bg-neutral-700 selection:text-white relative\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background System: V-Shape Vertical Bars -->\n    <div id=\"v-bars-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 flex items-end justify-center px-4 md:px-10 opacity-70\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0;\">\n        <!-- JS will inject 25 bars here -->\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Green Background Glow Layer -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] max-w-full h-[600px] bg-[#10b981]/60 blur-[120px] rounded-[9999px] pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-50 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Container -->\n    <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto relative border-x border-white/5 min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-transparent z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Frame Corner Brackets -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/20\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation / Brand (Bounded max-w-2xl) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto pt-6 px-4 relative z-20\">\n            <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 9999px; background: rgba(43,45,48,0.7);\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white text-sm\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:round-alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium tracking-wide\">VERTEX</span>\n                </div>\n                <nav class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-[#a9b7c6] hover:text-white transition-colors hidden sm:block\">Documentation</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white px-4 py-2 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 9999px; background: rgba(43,45,48,0.7);\">Sign In</a>\n                </nav>\n            </header>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Immersive Hero Section inside Premium Card -->\n        <section class=\"p-4 md:p-10 relative flex-grow flex flex-col items-center\">\n            <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto flex-grow rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-2xl overflow-hidden z-20 mt-8\">\n\n                <!-- Inner Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#1e1e1e]/80 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-12 px-4\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1e1e1e] via-[#1e1e1e]/40 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Content Overlay: Hero Information Architecture -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center w-full max-w-3xl text-center mb-16\">\n\n                        <!-- Eyebrow -->\n                        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-white mb-8 shadow-sm hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 9999px; background: rgba(43,45,48,0.7);\">\n                            <span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                                <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#10b981] opacity-75\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#10b981]\"></span>\n                            </span>\n                            Vertex Engine v2.4.0 active\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Primary Headline -->\n                        <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight font-medium gsap-reveal\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\">\n                            Orchestrate your systems<br>from a unified terminal\n                        </h1>\n\n                        <!-- Supporting Copy -->\n                        <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-[#a9b7c6] mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-light gsap-reveal\">\n                            Synchronize your environments seamlessly. Codebases, deployment pipelines, package registries, and developer workflows remain perfectly aligned via a console optimized for performance.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <!-- CTA Cluster -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 mb-10 w-full sm:w-auto gsap-reveal\">\n                            <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto h-12 px-8 bg-white text-[#1e1e1e] text-sm font-medium hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-300 ease-out active:scale-95 inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2\" style=\"border-radius: 9999px; box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255,255,255,1);\">\n                                Initialize Vertex\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                            <div class=\"w-full sm:w-auto h-12 px-6 text-white text-sm font-light hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-3 group cursor-pointer\" title=\"Copy install command\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 9999px; background: rgba(43,45,48,0.7);\">\n                                <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-[#a9b7c6] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">npm i -g vertex-cli</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:copy-linear\" class=\"text-base text-[#a9b7c6] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Proof / Detail Layer -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#a9b7c6] font-light gsap-reveal\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            End-to-end encrypted. Vertex analyzes metrics without exposing proprietary logic.\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Visual Anchor (CLI App) -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-20 w-full max-w-[650px] mx-auto perspective-1000\">\n                        <!-- CLI Component Wrapper -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#10b981]/40 via-white/10 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(16,185,129,0.2)] backdrop-blur-xl transform transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_20px_100px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)] duration-500\">\n\n                            <!-- CLI Terminal Body -->\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#2b2d30]/95 rounded-[32px] w-full text-xs font-mono text-[#a9b7c6] ring-1 ring-white/10 overflow-hidden shadow-inner backdrop-blur-2xl\">\n\n                                <!-- Window Controls -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-4 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- CLI Content -->\n                                <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n\n                                    <!-- Top Meta -->\n                                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs tracking-widest text-[#a9b7c6] uppercase\">\n                                        <span>VERTEX · cross-repo orchestration</span>\n                                        <span class=\"text-white\">v2.4.0</span>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <!-- Main Status -->\n                                    <div class=\"leading-relaxed\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white mb-2\">\n                                            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10b981] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,1)]\"></span>\n                                            <span class=\"font-medium\">core-platform</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white/30\">·</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-[#a9b7c6]\">@vertex-org</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white/30\">·</span>\n                                            <span>3 repos</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white/30\">·</span>\n                                            <span>42 modules</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pl-4 text-[#a9b7c6]\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-[#10b981]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            <span>12 deployments pending</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white/30 ml-auto\">/execute</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <!-- Health Section -->\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-white/40 uppercase mb-3 pl-4\">Diagnostics</div>\n\n                                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_3rem_1fr_3rem_1fr] gap-x-2 gap-y-2 pl-4 items-center\">\n                                            <!-- Row 1 -->\n                                            <span class=\"text-white/30 text-right\">»</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white\">build</span>\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                                <div class=\"w-20 h-1.5 rounded-[9999px] overflow-hidden bg-white/10\">\n                                                    <div class=\"w-[100%] h-full bg-[#10b981] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.8)]\"></div>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <span class=\"text-[#a9b7c6]\">ok</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white/40\">time</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white\">45s</span>\n\n                                            <!-- Row 2 -->\n                                            <span class=\"text-transparent\">»</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-[#a9b7c6]\">tests</span>\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                                <div class=\"w-20 h-1.5 rounded-[9999px] overflow-hidden bg-white/10\">\n                                                    <div class=\"w-[85%] h-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\"></div>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <span class=\"text-[#a9b7c6]\">85%</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white/40\">pass</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-white\">2.4k</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <!-- Activity Section -->\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-white/40 uppercase mb-3 pl-4\">Activity Log</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_3.5rem_1fr] gap-2 pl-4 items-start\">\n                                                <span class=\"text-[#10b981] text-right mt-0.5\">»</span>\n                                                <span class=\"text-white/40\">10m ago</span>\n                                                <span class=\"text-white\">deployed production cluster eu-west</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_3.5rem_1fr] gap-2 pl-4 items-start\">\n                                                <span class=\"text-transparent\">»</span>\n                                                <span class=\"text-white/40\">1h ago</span>\n                                                <span class=\"text-[#a9b7c6]\">merged PR #1420 — optimize render loop</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <!-- Bottom Input Line -->\n                                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                            <span class=\"font-light text-[#10b981] text-sm\">&gt;</span>\n                                            <span class=\"w-2 h-4 bg-white animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\"></span>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <span class=\"text-white/40 text-xs tracking-wide\">type /help for commands</span>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- DOM V-Curve Vertical Bar Background Setup ---\n        const initVBars = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('v-bars-container');\n            if (!container) return;\n\n            const numBars = 25;\n            const bars = [];\n            const center = Math.floor(numBars / 2);\n\n            // Build the bars matching the strict code pattern but injected securely\n            for (let i = 0; i < numBars; i++) {\n                const bar = document.createElement('div');\n                bar.className = 'v-bar w-full mx-[1px] sm:mx-[2px] md:mx-1';\n                bar.style.cssText = `\n                    flex: 1;\n                    transform-origin: bottom;\n                    background: linear-gradient(to top, #1e1e1e 0%, #065f46 22%, #ffffff 42%, #10b981 65%, transparent 95%);\n                    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n                    height: 100%;\n                    will-change: transform, opacity;\n                `;\n                container.appendChild(bar);\n                bars.push({ el: bar, index: i });\n            }\n\n            const animate = (time) => {\n                const t = time * 0.0015;\n\n                bars.forEach((barObj) => {\n                    const distFromCenter = Math.abs(barObj.index - center);\n                    const normalizedDist = distFromCenter / center;\n\n                    // V-shape height calculation\n                    const vBase = 0.1 + (Math.pow(normalizedDist, 1.4) * 0.7);\n\n                    // Vertical breathing wave using sine function (Math.sin)\n                    const wave = Math.sin(t + distFromCenter * 0.5) * 0.15;\n\n                    const scaleY = Math.max(0.05, Math.min(1, vBase + wave));\n                    const opacity = 0.3 + (scaleY * 0.7) + (Math.sin(t * 2 + distFromCenter * 0.3) * 0.1);\n\n                    barObj.el.style.transform = `scaleY(${scaleY})`;\n                    barObj.el.style.opacity = Math.max(0.1, Math.min(1, opacity));\n                });\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP and Text Setup ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            initVBars();\n\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const splitTextForReveal = (element) => {\n                const textNodes = Array.from(element.childNodes).filter(node => node.nodeType === Node.TEXT_NODE);\n\n                textNodes.forEach(node => {\n                    const words = node.textContent.split(/(\\s+)/);\n                    const fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();\n\n                    words.forEach(word => {\n                        if (word.trim().length > 0) {\n                            const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                            wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                            wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                            wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n\n                            const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                            inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                            inner.style.transform = 'translateY(100%)';\n                            inner.className = 'reveal-inner';\n                            inner.textContent = word;\n\n                            wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                            fragment.appendChild(wrapper);\n                        } else {\n                            fragment.appendChild(document.createTextNode(word));\n                        }\n                    });\n\n                    node.parentNode.replaceChild(fragment, node);\n                });\n            };\n\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.gsap-reveal');\n\n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                if (el.tagName === 'H1' || el.tagName === 'P') {\n                    splitTextForReveal(el);\n                    gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-inner'), {\n                        y: \"0%\",\n                        duration: 1.2,\n                        stagger: 0.04,\n                        ease: \"power4.out\",\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: el,\n                            start: \"top 90%\",\n                            toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                        }\n                    });\n                } else {\n                    gsap.fromTo(el,\n                        { y: 20, opacity: 0 },\n                        { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power4.out\", delay: 0.4,\n                          scrollTrigger: {\n                              trigger: el,\n                              start: \"top 95%\",\n                              toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                          }\n                        }\n                    );\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "cli-dashboard-jetbrains-emerald-model.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/cli-dashboard-jetbrains-emerald-model.jpg", "source_name": "cli-dashboard-jetbrains-emerald-model-DESIGN.md", "views": 150, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:58:36.524613+00:00"}